# Java / Maven
# ==============================
**/target/
**/build/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Maven wrapper: keep wrapper scripts and configuration tracked
# Do not ignore .mvn/wrapper/

# ==============================
# Node.js / npm
# ==============================
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Package manager logs
*.log

